{"seq":1,"slug":"mfe-overview","title":"微前端概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts/mfe-overview","wordCount":1201,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"微前端概述\">微前端概述</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端（Micro Frontends）是一种将前端单体应用拆分为多个独立开发、独立部署、独立运行的小型前端应用的架构模式。其核心理念借鉴了微服务架构在后端的成功实践——让不同团队能够自主地选择技术栈、独立地开发和发布各自负责的业务模块，同时在用户侧呈现为一个完整的应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 微前端架构&#10;        SH[Shell / 主应用] --&gt; MF1[子应用 A - React]&#10;        SH --&gt; MF2[子应用 B - Vue]&#10;        SH --&gt; MF3[子应用 C - Angular]&#10;        SH --&gt; SC[共享组件库]&#10;    end&#10;    U[用户] --&gt; SH\">graph TD\n    subgraph 微前端架构\n        SH[Shell / 主应用] --&gt; MF1[子应用 A - React]\n        SH --&gt; MF2[子应用 B - Vue]\n        SH --&gt; MF3[子应用 C - Angular]\n        SH --&gt; SC[共享组件库]\n    end\n    U[用户] --&gt; SH</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单体前端</th>\n<th>微前端</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>团队规模</td>\n<td>1 个前端团队</td>\n<td>多个自治团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术栈</td>\n<td>统一</td>\n<td>各团队自选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署</td>\n<td>整体部署</td>\n<td>独立部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码耦合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（明确边界）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建速度</td>\n<td>随规模下降</td>\n<td>各应用独立构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏性能</td>\n<td>需代码分割优化</td>\n<td>按需加载子应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"微前端的适用场景\">微前端的适用场景</h2><p>微前端不是万能方案——它引入了额外的架构复杂性。在决定是否采用微前端之前，需要评估以下条件：产品规模是否足够大（通常 10+ 人的前端团队才有拆分价值）、是否存在多个业务域需要独立迭代、是否有跨技术栈集成的需求（如收购整合、渐进式迁移）。</p>\n<p>适合微前端的典型场景包括大型 B 端 SaaS 平台（不同业务模块由不同团队负责）、企业内部门户（聚合多个独立子系统）、遗留系统渐进迁移（新模块用新框架，老模块保持不变）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MicroFrontendApp {&#10;  readonly name: string;&#10;  readonly version: string;&#10;  readonly entry: string;&#10;  readonly activeRule: string | ((location: Location) =&gt; boolean);&#10;  readonly container: string;&#10;  readonly props?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MFERegistry {&#10;  register(app: MicroFrontendApp): void;&#10;  getApp(name: string): MicroFrontendApp | undefined;&#10;  getActiveApps(location: Location): ReadonlyArray&lt;MicroFrontendApp&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createRegistry = (): MFERegistry =&gt; {&#10;  const apps = new Map&lt;string, MicroFrontendApp&gt;();&#10;  return {&#10;    register: (app) =&gt; apps.set(app.name, app),&#10;    getApp: (name) =&gt; apps.get(name),&#10;    getActiveApps: (location) =&gt;&#10;      [...apps.values()].filter((app) =&gt;&#10;        typeof app.activeRule === &#39;function&#39; ? app.activeRule(location) : location.pathname.startsWith(app.activeRule),&#10;      ),&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> activeRule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MFERegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MicroFrontendApp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getActiveApps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MicroFrontendApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MFERegistry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> apps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MicroFrontendApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(app.name, app),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    getApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> apps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    getActiveApps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">apps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.activeRule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'function'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">activeRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(location) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> location.pathname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(app.activeRule),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不适合微前端的场景包括小型项目（拆分带来的收益不足以抵消复杂性开销）、高度耦合的 UI（如所见即所得编辑器，各模块间需要频繁细粒度交互）和性能极度敏感的 C 端应用（微前端的运行时开销可能影响核心 Web Vitals）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐度</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大型 B 端平台 (10+ 前端)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>团队自治、独立迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业门户聚合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多系统集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渐进式技术迁移</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>新旧技术共存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小型项目 (&lt;5 人)</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>复杂性开销大于收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强交互 C 端应用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>性能开销、交互复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"微前端的核心挑战\">微前端的核心挑战</h2><p>微前端架构需要解决四个核心工程挑战：应用加载与路由、样式隔离、JavaScript 沙箱和跨应用通信。</p>\n<p>应用加载需要解决「何时加载、加载什么、如何激活」的问题。主应用需要根据路由规则动态加载对应的子应用，加载完成后将子应用挂载到指定的 DOM 容器中。</p>\n<p>样式隔离防止不同子应用的 CSS 互相污染。CSS Modules、Shadow DOM 和运行时样式前缀是三种主流方案。</p>\n<p>JavaScript 沙箱防止子应用修改全局变量影响其他应用。Proxy 沙箱通过拦截 window 属性的读写实现全局变量隔离。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 核心挑战&#10;        L[应用加载] --&gt; R[路由管理]&#10;        S[样式隔离] --&gt; CSS[CSS 冲突防护]&#10;        J[JS 沙箱] --&gt; G[全局变量隔离]&#10;        C[跨应用通信] --&gt; E[事件总线/共享状态]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 核心挑战\n        L[应用加载] --&gt; R[路由管理]\n        S[样式隔离] --&gt; CSS[CSS 冲突防护]\n        J[JS 沙箱] --&gt; G[全局变量隔离]\n        C[跨应用通信] --&gt; E[事件总线/共享状态]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Sandbox {&#10;  activate(): void;&#10;  deactivate(): void;&#10;  getProxy(): WindowProxy;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createProxySandbox = (name: string): Sandbox =&gt; {&#10;  const fakeWindow = Object.create(null);&#10;  let isActive = false;&#10;  const proxy = new Proxy(fakeWindow, {&#10;    get: (target, key: string) =&gt; {&#10;      if (key in target) return target[key];&#10;      const value = (window as Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;)[key];&#10;      return typeof value === &#39;function&#39; ? value.bind(window) : value;&#10;    },&#10;    set: (target, key: string, value) =&gt; {&#10;      if (isActive) {&#10;        target[key] = value;&#10;      }&#10;      return true;&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;  return {&#10;    activate: () =&gt; {&#10;      isActive = true;&#10;    },&#10;    deactivate: () =&gt; {&#10;      isActive = false;&#10;    },&#10;    getProxy: () =&gt; proxy as unknown as WindowProxy,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Sandbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  activate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  deactivate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getProxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WindowProxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createProxySandbox</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Sandbox</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fakeWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isActive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> proxy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Proxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fakeWindow, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target[key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)[key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'function'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(window) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isActive) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target[key] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    activate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      isActive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    deactivate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      isActive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    getProxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proxy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WindowProxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"技术栈无关性\">技术栈无关性</h2><p>技术栈无关性是微前端最吸引人的特性之一——不同子应用可以使用不同的前端框架（React、Vue、Angular、Svelte 等）。但这个自由度是有代价的：不同框架的运行时会被重复加载，增加整体包体积和内存占用。</p>\n<p>实践中的建议是「允许不同但鼓励统一」——在组织层面提供推荐技术栈和共享组件库，只在有充分理由时（如遗留代码、特殊性能要求）才使用不同的框架。同时通过共享依赖机制（Module Federation 的 shared 配置）避免重复加载相同的运行时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>微前端将前端单体拆分为独立开发、独立部署的子应用，实现团队自治和技术栈灵活性</li>\n<li>适用于大型 B 端平台、企业门户聚合和渐进式技术迁移等场景</li>\n<li>核心挑战包括应用加载与路由、样式隔离、JS 沙箱和跨应用通信</li>\n<li>Proxy 沙箱通过拦截 window 属性读写实现全局变量隔离</li>\n<li>技术栈无关性应遵循「允许不同但鼓励统一」的原则，避免运行时冗余</li>\n<li>微前端引入的架构复杂性需要与团队规模和业务需求匹配，小型项目不建议采用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"mfe-vs-monolith\">微前端与单体架构对比</a>——判断「该不该上微前端」的复杂性权衡。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"mfe-design-principles\">微前端设计原则</a>——拆分、契约与故障隔离的具体策略。</li>\n<li>跨学科：<a href=\"../../../cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/service-decomposition\">服务拆分与边界</a>——微前端的「拆分」直接借鉴分布式系统的服务边界划分，对比理解技术解耦与组织解耦。</li>\n<li>跨学科：<a href=\"../../frontend-architecture-patterns/architecture-evolution/technology-selection-framework\">技术选型决策框架</a>——把「是否引入微前端」放进系统化的选型评估流程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微前端概述","id":"微前端概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端的适用场景","id":"微前端的适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"微前端的核心挑战","id":"微前端的核心挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"技术栈无关性","id":"技术栈无关性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"微前端设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/micro-frontends/mfe-concepts/mfe-design-principles"}}